WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.875
Gate 3 has six steps.

2
00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:06.361
One: aggregate HR into SailPoint
as the authoritative source,

3
00:00:06.361 --> 00:00:09.088
read-only under Gate 2's first pattern.

4
00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:13.524
Two: connect Entra ID and Active
Directory as SailPoint sources, the Entra

5
00:00:13.524 --> 00:00:18.250
connector and the Active Directory
connector through the virtual appliance.

6
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.550
Three: correlate on employee
I D, the key Book 03 joins on,

7
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:28.762
and treat uncorrelated accounts as orphan
candidates, not errors to suppress.

8
00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:33.924
Four: turn on Native Change Detection on
the Entra and Active Directory sources.

9
00:00:33.924 --> 00:00:37.394
It compares stored and newly
read data on aggregation,

10
00:00:37.394 --> 00:00:39.938
and fires one event per changed account.

11
00:00:39.938 --> 00:00:43.838
Five: run the kit's drift
reconciliation, read-only.

12
00:00:43.838 --> 00:00:46.899
And six: file the first
run as the baseline.

13
00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:50.012
Expect a burst of High
findings in the first month.

14
00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:52.920
Book 03 calls that the
measurement working.
